el independently addressable for flexible content zones (menu, promotions, order status). Includes video wall controller and mounting frame.\", \"sku\": \"BL-DMB-VW01\", \"brand\": {\"@type\": \"Brand\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\"}, \"manufacturer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/video-wall-menu-system-3x3\", \"category\": \"signage-solutions\", \"image\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/brightluxx/site-images/prod_video-wall-menu-system-3x3.webp\", \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\", \"lowPrice\": 500, \"highPrice\": 15000, \"offerCount\": 1, \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\", \"seller\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/video-wall-menu-system-3x3\"}, \"additionalProperty\": [{\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Pixel Pitch\", \"value\": \"N/A (LCD Panels)\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Brightness\", \"value\": \"700 nits\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the total resolution of the Video Wall Menu System 3x3?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The system features a total resolution of 6K, achieved through nine 55-inch LCD panels configured in a 3x3 layout, delivering clear and vibrant visuals ideal for menu displays.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How bright is the video wall and is it suitable for environments with ambient lighting?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"With a brightness rating of 700 nits, the video wall offers excellent visibility in brightly lit environments such as food halls and stadium concessions, ensuring menu content remains readable.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What are the installation requirements and is mounting hardware included?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Installation is simplified with the included wall bracket designed for secure mounting of the 3x3 panel array. Professional installation is recommended to ensure alignment and proper configuration.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Does the system support multiple content zones for displaying menus and promotions simultaneously?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, each panel is independently addressable allowing flexible configuration of 1 to 9 content zones. This enables simultaneous display of menus, promotions, and order status updates.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does this video wall system compare to single large-format LED displays?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Unlike single large LED panels, this 3x3 video wall offers ultra-narrow bezels at 0.88mm for a near-seamless image with enhanced flexibility in content management across multiple zones, making it ideal for dynamic food service environments.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is a warranty provided with the Video Wall Menu System 3x3?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx provides a standard warranty that covers hardware defects and panel performance, ensuring reliable operation. Specific warranty terms can be provided upon request.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can this system be integrated with existing digital signage software?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, the included video wall controller supports integration with most leading digital signage software solutions, facilitating easy content management and scheduling.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What types of food service environments is this system best suited for?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"This product is designed specifically for high-volume quick service restaurants, food halls, and stadium concession areas where large-format, flexible menu displays are essential for customer engagement and operational efficiency.\"}}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Products\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Video Wall Menu System 3x3\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/video-wall-menu-system-3x3\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"legalName\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"contactPoint\": {\"@type\": \"ContactPoint\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"contactType\": \"sales\", \"areaServed\": [\"AE\", \"SA\", \"QA\", \"KW\", \"BH\", \"OM\"], \"availableLanguage\": [\"en\", \"ar\"]}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"LocalBusiness\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"image\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"priceRange\": \"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\u00b2\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"geo\": {\"@type\": \"GeoCoordinates\", \"latitude\": 24.9857, \"longitude\": 55.0272}, \"openingHoursSpecification\": {\"@type\": \"OpeningHoursSpecification\", \"dayOfWeek\": [\"Monday\", \"Tuesday\", \"Wednesday\", \"Thursday\", \"Friday\", \"Saturday\"], \"opens\": \"09:00\", \"closes\": \"18:00\"}, \"areaServed\": [\"Dubai\", \"Abu Dhabi\", \"United Arab Emirates\", \"Saudi Arabia\", \"Qatar\", \"Kuwait\", \"Bahrain\", \"Oman\"]}</script><div><h1>Video Wall Menu System 3x3</h1><p>Discover the Video Wall Menu System 3x3 in Dubai. Enhance visibility with our premium LED solution. Contact Brightluxx for tailored installations in UAE!</p><p><strong>Large-format video wall for high-volume food service.</strong></p><p>Pre-configured 3x3 video wall system for large QSR locations, food halls, and stadium concessions. Ultra-narrow 0.88mm bezel for near-seamless appearance. Each panel independently addressable for flexible content zones (menu, promotions, order status). Includes video wall controller and mounting frame.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What is the total resolution of the Video Wall Menu System 3x3?</h3><p>The system features a total resolution of 6K, achieved through nine 55-inch LCD panels configured in a 3x3 layout, delivering clear and vibrant visuals ideal for menu displays.</p><h3>How bright is the video wall and is it suitable for environments with ambient lighting?</h3><p>With a brightness rating of 700 nits, the video wall offers excellent visibility in brightly lit environments such as food halls and stadium concessions, ensuring menu content remains readable.</p><h3>What are the installation requirements and is mounting hardware included?</h3><p>Installation is simplified with the included wall bracket designed for secure mounting of the 3x3 panel array. Professional installation is recommended to ensure alignment and proper configuration.</p><h3>Does the system support multiple content zones for displaying menus and promotions simultaneously?</h3><p>Yes, each panel is independently addressable allowing flexible configuration of 1 to 9 content zones. This enables simultaneous display of menus, promotions, and order status updates.</p></div></main><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/310vm2bl3xxpt.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[31262,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"PageViewTracker\\\"]\\n3:I[39756,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n4:I[37457,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n6:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"OutletBoundary\\\"]\\n7:\\\"$Sreact.suspense\\\"\\na:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"ViewportBoundary\\\"]\\nc:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"MetadataBoundary\\\"]\\ne:I[68027,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\",1]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n9:X\\n0:{\\\"P\\\":null,\\\"c\\\":[\\\"\\\",\\\"products\\\",\\\"video-wall-menu-system-3x3\\\"],\\\"q\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"i\\\":false,\\\"f\\\":[[[\\\"\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"slug\\\",\\\"products/video-wall-menu-system-3x3\\\",\\\"c\\\",[\\\"products\\\"]],{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"__PAGE__\\\",{},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",4608]},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",4608]},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",4624],[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$1\\\",\\\"c\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"stylesheet\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css