htly lit environments such as food halls and stadium concessions, ensuring menu content remains readable.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat are the installation requirements and is mounting hardware included?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eInstallation is simplified with the included wall bracket designed for secure mounting of the 3x3 panel array. Professional installation is recommended to ensure alignment and proper configuration.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eDoes the system support multiple content zones for displaying menus and promotions simultaneously?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eYes, each panel is independently addressable allowing flexible configuration of 1 to 9 content zones. This enables simultaneous display of menus, promotions, and order status updates.\\u003c/p\\u003e14:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$15\\\"}}]\\nb:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"charSet\\\":\\\"utf-8\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"viewport\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\\\"}]]\\n8:null\\nd:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"title\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Video Wall Menu System 3x3 | Premium LED Display Dubai | Brightluxx\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"description\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Discover the Video Wall Menu System 3x3 in Dubai. Enhance visibility with our premium LED solution. Contact Brightluxx for tailored installations in UAE!\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"2\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"canonical\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"https://brightluxx.com/products/video-wall-menu-system-3x3\\\"}]]\\n\"])</script></body></html>","rsc":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:I[31262,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"PageViewTracker\"]\n3:I[39756,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"default\"]\n4:I[37457,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"default\"]\n6:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"OutletBoundary\"]\n7:\"$Sreact.sus