s://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"image\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"priceRange\\\": \\\"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\\\u00b2\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"geo\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"GeoCoordinates\\\", \\\"latitude\\\": 24.9857, \\\"longitude\\\": 55.0272}, \\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\", \\\"dayOfWeek\\\": [\\\"Monday\\\", \\\"Tuesday\\\", \\\"Wednesday\\\", \\\"Thursday\\\", \\\"Friday\\\", \\\"Saturday\\\"], \\\"opens\\\": \\\"09:00\\\", \\\"closes\\\": \\\"18:00\\\"}, \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"Abu Dhabi\\\", \\\"United Arab Emirates\\\", \\\"Saudi Arabia\\\", \\\"Qatar\\\", \\\"Kuwait\\\", \\\"Bahrain\\\", \\\"Oman\\\"]}\"}}]\n15:T6c0,<h1>Video Wall Menu System 3x3</h1><p>Discover the Video Wall Menu System 3x3 in Dubai. Enhance visibility with our premium LED solution. Contact Brightluxx for tailored installations in UAE!</p><p><strong>Large-format video wall for high-volume food service.</strong></p><p>Pre-configured 3x3 video wall system for large QSR locations, food halls, and stadium concessions. Ultra-narrow 0.88mm bezel for near-seamless appearance. Each panel independently addressable for flexible content zones (menu, promotions, order status). Includes video wall controller and mounting frame.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What is the total resolution of the Video Wall Menu System 3x3?</h3><p>The system features a total resolution of 6K, achieved through nine 55-inch LCD panels configured in a 3x3 layout, delivering clear and vibrant visuals ideal for menu displays.</p><h3>How bright is the video wall and is it suitable for environments with ambient lighting?</h3><p>With a brightness rating of 700 nits, the video wall offers excellent visibility in brightly lit environments such as food halls and stadium concessions, ensuring menu content remains readable.</p><h3>What are the installation requirements and is mounting hardware included?</h3><p>Installation is simplified with the included wall bracket designed for secure mounting of the 3x3 panel array. Professional installation is recommended to ensure alignment and proper configuration.</p><h3>Does the system support multiple content zones for displaying menus and promotions simultaneously?</h3><p>Yes, each panel is independently addressable allowing flexible configuration of 1 to 9 content zones. This enables simultaneous display of menus, promotions, and order status updates.</p>14:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$15\"}}]\nb:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\n8:null\nd:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Video Wall Menu System 3x3 | Premium LED Display Dubai | Brightluxx\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Discover the Video Wall Menu System 3x3 in Dubai. Enhance visibility with our premium LED solution. Contact Brightluxx for tailored installations in UAE!\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://brightluxx.com/products/video-wall-menu-system-3x3\"}]]\n","segmentData":{"/_tree":":HL[\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\",\"style\"]\n0:{\"tree\":{\"name\":\"\",\"param\":null,\"prefetchHints\":4176,\"slots\":{\"children\":{\"name\":\"slug\",\"param\":{\"type\":\"c\",\"key\":\"products/video-wall-menu-system-3x3\",\"siblings\":[\"products\"]},\"prefetchHints\":4192,\"slots\":{\"children\":{\"name\":\"__PAGE__\",\"param\":null,\"prefetchHints\":4256,\"slots\":null}}}}},\"staleTime\":300,\"buildId\":\"0VevTopRFbkV79u5_PhIJ\"}\n","/_full":"1:\"$Sreact.fr