tps://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/video-wall-menu-system-3x3\", \"category\": \"signage-solutions\", \"image\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/brightluxx/site-images/prod_video-wall-menu-system-3x3.webp\", \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\", \"lowPrice\": 500, \"highPrice\": 15000, \"offerCount\": 1, \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\", \"seller\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/video-wall-menu-system-3x3\"}, \"additionalProperty\": [{\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Pixel Pitch\", \"value\": \"N/A (LCD Panels)\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Brightness\", \"value\": \"700 nits\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}10:Tb62,{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the total resolution of the Video Wall Menu System 3x3?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The system features a total resolution of 6K, achieved through nine 55-inch LCD panels configured in a 3x3 layout, delivering clear and vibrant visuals ideal for menu displays.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How bright is the video wall and is it suitable for environments with ambient lighting?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"With a brightness rating of 700 nits, the video wall offers excellent visibility in brightly lit environments such as food halls and stadium concessions, ensuring menu content remains readable.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What are the installation requirements and is mounting hardware included?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Installation is simplified with the included wall bracket designed for secure mounting of the 3x3 panel array. Professional installation is recommended to ensure alignment and proper configuration.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Does the system support multiple content zones for displaying menus and promotions simultaneously?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, each panel is independently addressable allowing flexible configuration of 1 to 9 content zones. This enables simultaneous display of menus, promotions, and order status updates.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does this video wall system compare to single large-format LED displays?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Unlike single large LED panels, this 3x3 video wall offers ultra-narrow bezels at 0.88mm for a near-seamless image with enhanced flexibility in content management across multiple zones, making it ideal for dynamic food service environments.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is a warranty provided with the Video Wall Menu System 3x3?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx provides a standard warranty that covers hardware defects and panel performance, ensuring reliable operation. Specific warranty terms can be provided upon request.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can this system be integrated with existing digital signage software?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, the included video wall controller supports integration with most leading digital signage software solutions, facilitating easy content management and scheduling.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What types of food service environments is this system best suited for?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"This product is designed specifically for high-volume quick service restaurants, food halls, and stadium concession areas where large-format, f